{"t":428164,"op":"edit","agent":"B","path":"skills/ultrawrite/references/greenfield-stack.md","vstart":120,"vend":128,"lines":["the store (operator, 2026-09-29). The template's `scripts/pack-client.ts`","(`bun run pack`) builds `client/index.html` and writes every output file into","`server/client-files.ts`, and `bun run deploy` runs `pack-client` before","`wrangler deploy`, so there is no second host for the page. The Worker answers","these routes and no others:","","- `/` — the page, public and read-only: it mounts only the `PUBLIC` pieces and","  re-reads `/public.json` every 5 s instead of syncing.","- `/public.json` — the saved snapshot of the store, read-only.","- `/health` — `200` when the Worker is up; what a plan's Verify line reads.","- `/staff` — the same page with every piece, its WebMCP tools and the sync."]}
